#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:10
msgid ""
"Momentum is a task planner for GNOME. Plan what you will do today, keep "
"projects and tags tidy, and get out of the way."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:11
msgid ""
"Keep tasks available offline and optionally sync your devices through "
"Nextcloud or LibreSync."
msgstr ""
"Nutze deine Aufgaben offline und synchronisiere deine Geräte auf Wunsch über "
"Nextcloud oder LibreSync."

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:13
msgid "Today, project and tag views"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid "Guided task creation with due day, estimate, tags and notes"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:15
msgid "Nextcloud sync and backup import"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:16
msgid "Keyboard first, with system-wide shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:17
msgid "Adaptive layout for phones and desktops"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:23
msgid "Today view with projects and tags in the sidebar"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:27
msgid "Coming Up: the next days grouped by day"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:31
msgid "Creating a task with a due day, time, reminder, estimate and tags"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:35
msgid ""
"Sync with nearby devices: link once with a pairing code, no server needed"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:46
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:71
msgid ""
"Fix task entry and navigation, add recurring previews and optional settings "
"transfer and sync."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:48
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:73
msgid ""
"Ten short CC0 task-completion sounds to choose and preview on Linux, macOS, "
"iOS and Android. Sound stays off by default; when enabled, the default "
"choice is 6 · Bright Finish."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:49
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:74
msgid ""
"Native Android app in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose with the shared Rust core: "
"offline tasks, organization, search, recurrence, reminders, optional "
"Nextcloud/LibreSync, Android Keystore, private drafts and SAF backups. "
"Native parity and physical accessibility acceptance remain in progress."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:50
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:75
msgid ""
"Android APK/AAB, matching source, dependency notices, R8 mapping and "
"provenance in the unified tagged release, with optional distribution signing "
"and explicit unsigned filenames otherwise. Release checksums cover all "
"distribution assets. No store upload."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:51
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:76
msgid ""
"Optional app-settings import/export, including an independent unchecked "
"option on task backups, and settings-only files. Credentials and device "
"controls stay local."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:52
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:77
msgid ""
"Optional settings sync over the selected Nextcloud or LibreSync connection, "
"with explicit initial-device choices and durable retry after interrupted "
"exchanges."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:53
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:78
msgid ""
"Read-only future recurring occurrences in Upcoming, with Edit repeat "
"schedule."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:54
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:79
msgid ""
"An opt-in, verified Nextcloud folder copy to momentum that retains the "
"original."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:55
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:80
msgid "Overdue tasks show a labeled callout and date across the native apps."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:56
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:81
msgid ""
"Copy Notes confirms success inside the editor, with native Apple/Android "
"feedback."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:57
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:82
msgid ""
"Momentum owns its crate names, URL entry points and customer-facing naming "
"while preserving existing task, backup and sync formats and required license "
"notices."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:58
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:83
msgid ""
"Linux task entry has concise guidance with a native tooltip and "
"accessibility text."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:59
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:84
msgid ""
"Linux: project selection in the task editor now displays and saves the "
"selected ID, including duplicate project names. Preferences fits "
"independently of a short parent."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:60
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:85
msgid ""
"iOS: the first project selection from Lists loads its tasks without a second "
"tap."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:61
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:86
msgid ""
"iOS: share-sheet tasks capture Today when added, retaining that day across a "
"delayed import or timezone change."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:62
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:87
msgid ""
"Fresh Nextcloud stores can create the required initial configuration safely."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:63
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:88
msgid ""
"Damaged task stores fail visibly before a network exchange instead of "
"opening empty."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:64
#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:89
msgid ""
"Folder-copy cancellation retains the original connection, including a late "
"cancel, and resumes automatic sync after cancellation."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:65
msgid ""
"Release-profile verification uses the runner's isolated test schema "
"consistently; production and development settings remain separate."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:95
msgid "Faster sync with safer retries and recovery"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:97
msgid ""
"Sync: unchanged Nextcloud files use conditional requests and a small durable "
"metadata update. Controlled tests measured 11.6× faster idle engine "
"exchanges with 10,000 tasks"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:98
msgid ""
"LibreSync: queued offline changes are published in one durable journal "
"batch; the 1,000-operation test measured 244× faster publication"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:99
msgid ""
"Sync: retry transient download and verification failures within the exchange "
"deadline, while retaining local edits when an upload or journal write cannot "
"be verified"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:100
msgid ""
"Sync: detect same-version remote replacements and damaged compressed copies; "
"improve English and German recovery messages across the native apps"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:101
msgid ""
"LibreSync: failed journal receipts and snapshots stay retryable instead of "
"suppressing later delivery"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:102
msgid ""
"iOS: after a background sync wake, automatic sync could stop until the next "
"edit or pull-to-refresh, so remote changes stayed out of sight; opening the "
"app during a wake now retries at once and the idle cycle is re-armed. A wake "
"that runs out of its time budget no longer shows as a sync failure"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:103
msgid ""
"macOS and Linux: with background sync on, bringing the window back now "
"redraws the list and syncs when the idle cycle was missed while hidden; "
"macOS keeps its background sync timers on cadence by declining App Nap while "
"syncing without a window"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:109
msgid "Share a link or text to Momentum from any iOS app."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:111
msgid ""
"iOS: share a link or text to Momentum from any app's share sheet. The sheet "
"shows a normalized title to edit and adds the task to Inbox with the link "
"first in its notes when Momentum next opens; the app and its extension now "
"share an App Group"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:117
msgid "Optional task-completion sound controlled by a setting, off by default."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:119
msgid ""
"Optional task-completion sound, off by default, in Linux Preferences, macOS "
"Settings and iOS Settings. A short bundled chime plays for completion; "
"reopen and undo are silent."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:125
msgid ""
"Optional Apple Reminders import on macOS and iOS, with reliable import "
"recovery."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:127
msgid ""
"macOS and iOS: optional one-way import from a selected Apple Reminders list, "
"with manual import and off-by-default automatic import while Momentum is "
"active"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:128
msgid ""
"Apple Reminders: prevent a crash when EventKit returns reminders on a "
"background queue"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:129
msgid ""
"Apple Reminders: retry failed fetches and saves, announce import results to "
"assistive technology, and retain newly discovered reminder identities to "
"avoid duplicate imports"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:130
msgid ""
"README and screenshot notes refreshed: October 2026 previews of all three "
"apps, the current platform status, what changed in 0.4, and how sync "
"failures and recovery work"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:131
msgid ""
"Linux: MOMENTUM_SCREENSHOT_SIZE=WIDTHxHEIGHT sizes a capture, and captures "
"render as the active window even when launched from a terminal"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:138
msgid ""
"macOS: completing the last task of Today (with completed tasks archived "
"immediately) could crash the app while the list emptied; the list now stays "
"in place and shows the empty state over it, and its sections keep stable "
"identities across updates"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:139
msgid ""
"Linux: closing the window no longer aborts the process when it is finalized"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:146
msgid ""
"Sync: an upload cut off by a slow connection could be stored by the server "
"as the sync file and lock every device out. Uploads now carry a checksum and "
"expected length, the stored size is checked afterwards, and a partial copy "
"is reported instead of trusted"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:147
msgid ""
"Sync: a large sync file over a slow or relayed connection no longer fails at "
"30 s; a foreground exchange may take up to five minutes while stalls still "
"fail fast"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:148
msgid ""
"Sync: a damaged server copy is told apart from a wrong encryption password"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:149
msgid ""
"Every platform: sync failures are explained in plain words with what to do "
"next; the technical message stays behind Details"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:150
msgid ""
"Every platform: Replace Server Copy publishes this device's tasks over a "
"damaged server copy (kept as sync-data.json.damaged) after confirmation; mo "
"sync --replace-remote does the same from the command line"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:151
msgid ""
"iOS: the sync failure section shows \"Trying again…\" and \"Last tried\" so "
"Try Again is visibly acknowledged"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:158
msgid ""
"iOS: pull down any list to reload it and run one exchange with the selected "
"sync provider"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:159
msgid ""
"iOS: View Options on every list (the ••• menu) with Group By, Sort By, Order "
"and, in Upcoming, the 7/30-day range; Settings › Task Lists keeps the same "
"choices"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:160
msgid ""
"iOS: View Options › Layout offers Regular and Compact task rows; Regular "
"rows are also a little tighter than before"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:161
msgid ""
"iOS: Settings › Sync has a Background section with the \"Sync in the "
"background\" switch"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:162
msgid ""
"Every platform: the task context menu's Move To submenu offers the two days "
"after tomorrow by their weekday names (\"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\")"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:163
msgid ""
"iOS: on an iPhone wide enough in landscape, the lists sidebar sits beside "
"the task list"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:164
msgid ""
"Linux and macOS: View Options › Layout offers Regular and Compact task rows"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:165
msgid ""
"iOS: the floating Add task control is a round plus button; it keeps the "
"\"Add task\" accessibility label, a 44 pt target, Dynamic Type scaling and "
"the Large Content Viewer"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:166
msgid ""
"iOS: a sync status badge in every list's navigation bar (spinner while "
"syncing, the provider symbol in the accent color, orange when attention is "
"needed) opens Settings › Sync; the text status at the end of the list stays "
"and now sits closer under the last task"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:167
msgid ""
"Every platform: Morning & Night grouping shows Morning first, then Today, "
"then Evening"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:168
msgid ""
"Every platform: sync runs twice as often: edits upload 10 s after they "
"settle and an idle app polls every 150 s; iOS background wakes may come "
"every 15 minutes"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:169
msgid ""
"iOS: navigation bars are Liquid Glass again; lists scroll underneath with "
"the system's soft edge effect instead of an opaque header"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:170
msgid ""
"iOS: pull to refresh is available only while a sync provider is selected"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:176
msgid ""
"Grouped context menus with Move To on Linux and iOS, and background sync on "
"every platform."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:178
msgid ""
"Linux: Preferences › Desktop › \"Sync in the background\" decides whether "
"automatic sync keeps running while the window is closed; Sync Now always "
"works"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:179
msgid ""
"iOS: Settings › Sync › \"Sync in the background\" lets iOS wake Momentum "
"occasionally for one bounded Nextcloud exchange; Low Power Mode and the "
"connection's automatic switch still apply"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:180
msgid ""
"Linux and iOS: the task context menu is grouped, with every Move to "
"destination (Morning, Tonight, Tomorrow, Next Week, Project) in one Move To "
"submenu; on Linux the menu now acts on the whole selection when the clicked "
"row is selected"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:181
msgid ""
"Linux: the empty search screen says \"Search\"; iOS: the search prompt is "
"\"Search\""
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:182
msgid "iOS: Settings › Task Lists notes that Upcoming is always grouped by day"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:188
msgid ""
"Coming Up by day, a customizable Mac toolbar, background sync control and "
"one main window."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:190
msgid ""
"macOS: View › Customize Toolbar… rearranges, removes and restores the "
"toolbar's items (New Task, Sync Now, View Options, plus optional Quick Add "
"and Archive Completed)"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:191
msgid ""
"macOS: Settings › Sync › \"Sync in the background\" decides whether "
"automatic sync keeps running while Momentum has no window open; Sync Now "
"always works"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:192
msgid ""
"Coming Up is always one section per day — Tomorrow, then the weekday names "
"of this week, then dates — on every platform; Group By is disabled while it "
"is showing, and its rows no longer repeat the day the heading names"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:193
msgid ""
"macOS: dragging a selected task lifts and moves the whole selection, one "
"item per task"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:194
msgid ""
"macOS: the task context menu is grouped, with every Move to destination "
"(Morning, Tonight, Tomorrow, Next Week, Project…) in one Move To submenu"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:195
msgid "macOS: the search field and empty search screen say \"Search\""
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:196
msgid ""
"The Linux and macOS apps' iOS sibling now carries the same version and build "
"number"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:197
msgid ""
"macOS: clicking the Dock icon while the app ran without a window could open "
"two main windows; the main window is now a single-instance scene"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:203
msgid "Auto-archive, Linux desktop parity, and one release for every platform."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:205
msgid ""
"Preferences › Tasks › \"Archive completed tasks immediately\": a completed "
"task goes straight to the archive and syncs; undo brings it back open"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:206
msgid ""
"Linux desktop parity: a native font chooser with independent content/"
"interface scaling, exact task reveal through mo open, GApplication actions "
"and task URLs, plus configurable Background Apps task-count modes"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:207
msgid ""
"One release process for every platform: build-aux/release.py keeps one "
"version across the Rust workspace, the GTK app, the macOS app, the metainfo "
